{
  "name": "PERIGEE PANIC: Stay In Orbit",
  "short_name": "PERIGEE PANIC: Stay In Orbit",
  "id": "com.rbgames.perigeepanic",
  "description": "**PERIGEE PANIC: Stay In Orbit**\n\nProtect Earth, blast incoming asteroids and keep your ship in orbit! Balance thrust, braking and momentum while gravity tries to turn you into Earth’s next crater.\n\nThe latest update brings:\n\n- **Ship and Earth shields**, with a recovery bounce when you hit a shielded Earth.\n- **Keyboard/mouse, gamepad and touch joystick controls**, with improved aiming, boosting and firing.\n- **A clearer icon-based HUD**, graphical pause/fire buttons and updated commander messages.\n- **Music and SFX settings** accessible from the title screen and in-game pause menu.\n- **Smoother music transitions**, with an intensified soundtrack when your hull becomes critical.\n- **A refreshed title sequence**, animated warp effects and layered scrolling space backgrounds.\n- **Redrawn artwork and a cohesive cartoon style**, with no AI-generated assets.\n- **Corrected asteroid spawning** for more consistent incoming threats.\n\n**RB Games — No Rules. Just Games.**",
  "orientation": "landscape",
  "start_url": "./index.html",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "black",
  "categories": ["games", "entertainment"],
